Recommends:
 podman | docker.io
Description: Dockerize MCP servers for safer interaction
 domcp wraps MCP server launch commands such as uvx, npx, and pipx in
 containers, proxying stdio or HTTP transports while mounting only the
 working directory by default.
 .
 Host environment variables are not forwarded unless explicitly exposed,
 which helps keep API keys and other sensitive host state out of MCP
 server containers.
